      "Categories": {
        "value": "William Crookes|Files with no machine-readable author|Double exposure|Electrical phenomena|Images uploaded by Fæ|Artworks without Wikidata item|1901-06-17|PD US expired|Black and white photographs of Colorado|Black and white photographs of the United States in the 1890s|December 1899 in Colorado|December 1899 United States photographs|Dickenson V. Alley|Electric discharge from Tesla coils|Colorado Springs Tesla Laboratory",
