        "value": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://wellcomeimages.org/indexplus/obf_images/4c/6e/da5709a57832dbbb048ba4a17fe6.jpg\">https://wellcomeimages.org/indexplus/obf_images/4c/6e/da5709a57832dbbb048ba4a17fe6.jpg</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Gallery: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://wellcomeimages.org/indexplus/image/M0014782.html\">https://wellcomeimages.org/indexplus/image/M0014782.html</a></li>\n<li>Photographer: Dickenson V. Alley</li>\n<li>Wellcome Collection gallery (2018-03-31): <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://wellcomecollection.org/works/zncts6ch\">https://wellcomecollection.org/works/zncts6ch</a></li></ul>",
