    "note": "Wardenclyffe wireless station, dated 1904 in the image record and published in Popular Electricity in June 1911. The tower stands behind the laboratory, not on its roof. The Commons file has documented border cropping.",
    "metadata": {
      "DateTime": {
        "value": "2016-10-08 12:26:06",
